**Tensor Puzzle #6: triu**

triu Compute [triu](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/generated/numpy.triu.html) - the upper triangular matrix.

```python
def triu_spec(out):
    for i in range(len(out)):
        for j in range(len(out)):
            if i <= j:
                out[i][j] = 1
            else:
                out[i][j] = 0

def triu(j: int) -> TT["j", "j"]:
    raise NotImplementedError


test_triu = make_test("triu", triu, triu_spec, add_sizes=["j"])
```

