**Tensor Puzzle #10: roll**

roll Compute [roll](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/generated/numpy.roll.html) - the vector shifted 1 circular position.

```python
def roll_spec(a, out):
    for i in range(len(out)):
        if i + 1 < len(out):
            out[i] = a[i + 1]
        else:
            out[i] = a[i + 1 - len(out)]

def roll(a: TT["i"], i: int) -> TT["i"]:
    raise NotImplementedError


test_roll = make_test("roll", roll, roll_spec, add_sizes=["i"])
```

