**Tensor Puzzle #15: bincount**

bincount Compute [bincount](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/generated/numpy.bincount.html) - count number of times an entry was seen.

```python
def bincount_spec(a, out):
    for i in range(len(a)):
        out[a[i]] += 1

def bincount(a: TT["i"], j: int) -> TT["j"]:
    raise NotImplementedError


def constraint_set_max(d):
    d["a"] = d["a"] % d["return"].shape[0]
    return d


test_bincount = make_test("bincount",
    bincount, bincount_spec, add_sizes=["j"], constraint=constraint_set_max
)
```

