**Tensor Puzzle #16: scatter_add**

scatter_add Compute [scatter_add](https://pytorch-scatter.readthedocs.io/en/1.3.0/functions/add.html) - add together values that link to the same location.

```python
def scatter_add_spec(values, link, out):
    for j in range(len(values)):
        out[link[j]] += values[j]

def scatter_add(values: TT["i"], link: TT["i"], j: int) -> TT["j"]:
    raise NotImplementedError


def constraint_set_max(d):
    d["link"] = d["link"] % d["return"].shape[0]
    return d


test_scatter_add = make_test("scatter_add",
    scatter_add, scatter_add_spec, add_sizes=["j"], constraint=constraint_set_max
)
```

