**Tensor Puzzle #19: heaviside**

heaviside Compute [heaviside](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/generated/numpy.heaviside.html)

```python
def heaviside_spec(a, b, out):
    for k in range(len(out)):
        if a[k] == 0:
            out[k] = b[k]
        else:
            out[k] = int(a[k] > 0)

def heaviside(a: TT["i"], b: TT["i"]) -> TT["i"]:
    raise NotImplementedError

test_heaviside = make_test("heaviside", heaviside, heaviside_spec)
```

